    "#      rather than averaging against a combined global cell pool rest baseline.\n",
    "#   3. Absolute Directional Ranking: Captures negative log-fold changes from the \n",
    "#      Adventitial contrast, converts them to absolute values, and repurposes \n",
    "#      them to rank highly-specific Inflammatory-over-Adventitial features.\n",
