    "#      combinations of core fibroblast types ('Alveolar', 'Adventitial', \n",
    "#      'Inflammatory', 'CTHRC1+').\n",
    "#   2. Intersection Filtering: Retains only genes that are strictly upregulated \n",
    "#      (LogFC > 0) across every single head-to-head matchup.\n",
